# Read by BuildKit next to the Dockerfile (paths are relative to the build
# context, the vivier/ directory). The image needs services/processor and
# the shared analysis package's sources (packages/analysis/src, built in the
# image: its dist/ and node_modules stay out like every other); the web app,
# its dependencies and build outputs stay out of the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
.wrangler
.output
.nitro
.tanstack
.cache
public
src
supabase
docs
bun.lock
services/processor/test
packages/analysis/src/**/*.test.ts
packages/analysis/README.md
